      "dom_id": "question-120787",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "In the regular octagon $ABCDEFGH$, we have $CD=1.5\\,cm.$ What is the perimeter of the octagon?",
      "worked_solution": "The perimeter $p$ of a polygon is the sum of the measures of all its sides. Since all the sides of a regular octagon are equal and the measure of one of them is $1.5\\,cm$, we have \n\n$$\np=8\\cdot CD=8\\cdot 1.5=12\\,cm.\n$$",
